00:43:02.158 --> 00:43:06.754
<i>Kalian semua sudah tahu sekarang betapa saya mencintai</i>
<i>cerita-cerita kecil, unik dari kota kecil...</i>

00:43:06.929 --> 00:43:10.262
<i>... yah, ini yang terbaik yang datang</i>
<i>ke meja ini dalam waktu lama.</i>

00:43:10.433 --> 00:43:13.698
<i>Bagaimana kalau kalian tahu bahwa</i>
<i>ada puluhan tubuh...</i>

00:43:14.003 --> 00:43:17.837
<i>... puluhan di antaranya,</i>
<i>terkubur di halaman belakang kalian?</i>

00:43:18.007 --> 00:43:22.501
S<i>uch was the case this week for a woman</i>
<i>in the small, quaint little Colorado town...</i>

00:43:22.678 --> 00:43:24.111
<i>... of Everwood.</i>

00:43:24.280 --> 00:43:27.181
<i>This discovery by a family doctor</i>
<i>who lives there...</i>

00:43:27.350 --> 00:43:30.877
<i>... came as the result of an investigation</i>
<i>by local authorities.</i>

00:43:31.053 --> 00:43:34.079
<i>And here's where the story gets</i>
<i>a little weird, my friends.</i>

00:43:34.257 --> 00:43:39.160
<i>Authorities were holding a senile</i>
<i>78-year-old man in custody...</i>

00:43:39.595 --> 00:43:44.828
<i>... after he confessed to murdering</i>
<i>someone over 30 years ago.</i>

00:44:20.102 --> 00:44:22.093
[ENGLISH]
